OL,3,GNEWSAFamily's 'incredibly painful' wait
OL,4,Afor justice over
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe brother of a motorcyclist killed in
OL,7,Fa crash involving a defective tractor
OL,8,Fsays his family can begin to look
OL,9,Fforward after an "incredibly painful"
OL,10,Ffour-year wait for justice.
OL,12,FDr Steven Lee, 26, was riding his
OL,13,Fmotorbike on the A40 near Ganarew,
OL,14,FRoss-on-Wye, on 11 August 2022 when he
OL,15,Fwas involved in the collision.
OL,17,FPhilip Baker, 61, of Wonastow,
OL,18,FMonmouthshire, was jailed for eight
OL,19,Fyears at Worcester Crown Court on
OL,20,FTuesday after being convicted of
OL,21,Fcausing death by dangerous driving.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,439,430,260,140,0,100
