OL,3,GNEWSAFamily's 'incredibly painful' wait
OL,4,Afor justice over
OL,5,
OL,6,FLee's brother, Danny Sargeant, said:
OL,7,F"Nothing is ever going to feel like
OL,8,Fenough but we think based on the law
OL,9,Fand the way the judge explained how he
OL,10,Fcame to that [sentence], we think that
OL,11,Fit's a fair outcome."
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
